  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 513.15 Construction Equipment Plate.\n\n(a) Construction equipment plates shall be issued to construction equipment, as defined in RSA 259:42.\n\n(b) Construction equipment plates shall:\n\n(1) Have the letters “CE” on the left vertical border;\n\n(2) Have 5 numerals; and\n\n(3) Have the words “CONSTRUCT EQUIP” on the right vertical border.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 514.15)",
